    "notes":  [
                  "Three release processes per version; three copies of one original 24-page PDF; two sweeps, 125% zoom, 1080x780 viewport.",
                  "Working-set and private-byte peaks are sampled, with a nominal 25ms interval. GPU, converters, OS cache and other desktop workloads are uncontrolled.",
                  "Readiness includes a 100ms stability interval. These observations do not establish a global speedup or rule out document-specific leaks.",
                  "Full native suites preceded the final left-alignment adjustment; final layout tests, static analysis and native screenshot cover that adjustment.",
                  "Windows x86 is tested under WOW64, not on a native 32-bit OS. Linux and macOS are not validated for this revision.",
                  "Local uncommitted build; no GitHub publication and no installer validation are claimed."
              ],
